.server.log

# The root .gitignore's diagnostic-render patterns (land-*.png, look-*.png, patch.*,
# grid-*.png, fine-*.png, chart-*.png, bottom*.png ...) are UNANCHORED, so they match at
# any depth and silently swallowed one vendored Cesium asset:
# public/vendor/cesium/Assets/Textures/maki/land-use.png. Re-include the whole vendored
# tree so a partial vendor can never be committed and pass unnoticed.
!public/vendor/**
